{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this (fairly short) <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong>, you guide <strong>Yvette</strong> through her daily life in her apartment. She's been living alone for some time now and she's noticing some strange details. <strong>Explore</strong> <strong>the locations</strong> with Yvette and lose track of time and space with her. Despite her isolation, you'll encounter several <strong>NPC</strong>s throughout the game who enrich the world around Yvette and provide information that she couldn't have discovered on her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.poster.avif?t=1757520021\" width=444 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.webm?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.mp4?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll solve some <strong>not-too-complicated puzzles</strong> and discover more about the story every day. Another gameplay aspect is your <strong>own decision-making</strong>, whether it is in dialogue or elsewhere, which influences the plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains <strong>mild horror elements</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921590?t=1757520021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/1de4132c424f5a00f46e91ddee8f8e7bef88a42a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757520021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/23d5c866d52b0e5163748fa9800be93f9c605a9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757520021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/23d5c866d52b0e5163748fa9800be93f9c605a9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757520021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains:\r\nMildl use of swear words,\r\nA dark and oppressive atmosphere,\r\nIllustrated violence,\r\nHorror elements and jump scares"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this (fairly short) <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong>, you guide <strong>Yvette</strong> through her daily life in her apartment. She's been living alone for some time now and she's noticing some strange details. <strong>Explore</strong> <strong>the locations</strong> with Yvette and lose track of time and space with her. Despite her isolation, you'll encounter several <strong>NPC</strong>s throughout the game who enrich the world around Yvette and provide information that she couldn't have discovered on her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.poster.avif?t=1757520021\" width=444 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.webm?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921590/extras/87061152c5792804788adf8b1a91b0a4.mp4?t=1757520021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll solve some <strong>not-too-complicated puzzles</strong> and discover more about the story every day. Anoth